        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">Available construction material and energy data refer to conditions in early 1980s in USA.\n\n# Included processes\nThe module includes: land use of the factory; energy (electricity and diesel) and material requirements for the construction of the facility; transport requirements during construction; energy and transport requirements (for non-contaminated inerts concrete with reinforcing bars) during decommissioning; disposal of the non-contaminated inerts. The non contaminated metals are assumed to be recycled</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
